<!DOCTYPE html>
<!--
================================================================================
 GLASS BOX  -  single file, no dependencies, works from file://
================================================================================

 BRAIN FILE FORMAT  (format "glassbox-brain", formatVersion 1)
 ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 A brain is exported as one UTF-8 JSON object:

 {
   "format": "glassbox-brain",          // constant, identifies the file type
   "formatVersion": 1,                  // integer; readers must reject higher versions
   "app": "Glass Box",
   "exportedAt": "2026-09-21T12:00:00.000Z",
   "name": "Alpha",                     // display name of the learning agent
   "taskId": "tictactoe",               // which game/task the brain plays ("tictactoe" | "nim")
   "taskVersion": 1,                    // version of that task's rules / state encoding
   "algorithm": "qlearning",            // "qlearning" | "menace"
   "brainRevision": 18234,              // increments every game the brain learns from
   "hyperparameters": {
     "alpha": 0.3,          // Q-learning learning rate
     "gamma": 0.9,          // Q-learning discount
     "epsilon": 0.05,       // current exploration rate (epsilon-greedy)
     "epsilonDecay": 0.9998,// epsilon *= epsilonDecay after every game
     "epsilonMin": 0.02,    // floor for epsilon
     "initialQ": 0,         // value of never-tried actions (Q-learning)
     "initialBeads": 4,     // MENACE: beads per move in a new matchbox
     "winBeads": 3, "drawBeads": 1, "lossBeads": -1   // MENACE reinforcement
   },
   "stats": {
     "gamesPlayed": 20000,  // games the brain learned from (self-play included)
     "wins": 15000, "losses": 400, "draws": 2600,   // vs. other opponents only
     "selfPlayGames": 2000,
     "taughtMoves": 3,      // human "good/bad move" nudges
     "created": "...ISO date...", "updated": "...ISO date..."
   },
   "history": [[games, winVsRandom, lossVsRandom, optimalMoveRate, avgTrainReward], ...],
                            // optional learning curve; rates are 0..1, reward -1..1, null = n/a
   "table": {               // the learned knowledge, one entry per known state
     "<stateKey>": [action, value, visits,  action, value, visits, ...],
     ...
   },
   "checksum": "1a2b3c4d"   // optional: FNV-1a 32-bit (hex, 8 chars) of JSON.stringify(table)
                            // exactly as it appears in the file. Delete it if you hand-edit the table.
 }

 Semantics of the table
   * Values are always from the point of view of the PLAYER TO MOVE in that state.
   * qlearning: value = Q(state, action), roughly in [-1, +1] (win = +1, draw = 0, loss = -1).
                visits = how many times the action was taken and updated.
   * menace:    value = number of beads for that move (>= 0), visits = games that used it.
   * Actions not listed have the default value (initialQ or initialBeads) and 0 visits.

 State keys and actions per task
   tictactoe  key: 9 chars, row-major, "X" / "O" / "-"   e.g. "X---O----"
                   X moves when counts are equal, otherwise O moves.
              action: cell index 0..8 = row*3 + col.
   nim        piles start at [1,3,5,7]; whoever takes the last stick wins.
              key: 4 digits = sticks left in each pile, e.g. "1357".
              action: pile*7 + (take-1), pile 0..3, take 1..7.

 Merge rule (used by "Merge" import): for every (state, action)
   q = (q1*n1 + q2*n2) / (n1 + n2)   (plain average when both n are 0),  n = n1 + n2

 HOW TO ADD A NEW TASK: see section "2. TASKS" in the script - write an object with
 the Task interface and call registerTask(). Everything else (learning, UI, replay,
 brain explorer, import/export) is generic.
================================================================================
-->
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Glass Box</title>
<style>
:root {
  --bg: #0d1117; --panel: #161b22; --panel2: #1c2230; --border: #2b3340;
  --text: #e6edf3; --muted: #8b95a3; --accent: #58a6ff; --good: #3fb950;
  --bad: #f85149; --warn: #d29922; --purple: #bc8cff;
  --x: #58a6ff; --o: #ff8f6b;
  --radius: 10px;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html, body { margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text);
  font: 15px/1.45 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; }
button, select, input, textarea { font: inherit; color: inherit; }
button { background: var(--panel2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 7px;
  padding: 6px 12px; cursor: pointer; }
button:hover:not(:disabled) { border-color: var(--accent); }
button:disabled { opacity: .45; cursor: default; }
button.primary { background: #1f6feb; border-color: #1f6feb; color: #fff; }
button.danger { color: var(--bad); }
button.small { padding: 2px 8px; font-size: 13px; }
select, input[type=text], input[type=number], textarea {
  background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 7px; padding: 5px 8px; }
textarea { width: 100%; min-height: 90px; font-family: ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12px; resize: vertical; }
input[type=range] { accent-color: var(--accent); }
input[type=checkbox] { accent-color: var(--accent); }
label { cursor: pointer; }
h2, h3 { margin: 0 0 10px; font-weight: 600; }
h3 { font-size: 15px; color: #c9d1d9; }
.muted { color: var(--muted); }
.mono { font-family: ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace; }
.small { font-size: 13px; }

header { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px 18px;
  align-items: center; padding: 10px 18px; background: rgba(13,17,23,.94); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  backdrop-filter: blur(6px); }
.brand { font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: .3px; }
.brand span { font-weight: 400; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin-left: 6px; }
nav.tabs { display: flex; gap: 4px; }
nav.tabs button { border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 16px; background: transparent; }
nav.tabs button.active { background: var(--accent); color: #0d1117; border-color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
.ai-picker { margin-left: auto; display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
#saveStatus { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }

main { max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 16px; }
.tab { display: none; }
.tab.active { display: block; }
.layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 16px; align-items: start; }
.col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; min-width: 0; }
@media (max-width: 960px) { .layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
.card { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 14px; min-width: 0; }
.row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 14px; align-items: center; }
.row + .row { margin-top: 8px; }
.spacer { flex: 1; }
.status { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; text-align: center; margin: 12px 0 4px; min-height: 27px; }
.hint { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); text-align: center; }

/* ---------- boards ---------- */
.board-wrap { display: flex; justify-content: center; padding: 12px 0 4px; }
.board.ttt { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 8px; width: min(420px, 88vw); }
.board.ttt .cell { aspect-ratio: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  background: var(--panel2); border: 2px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; font-size: clamp(38px, 10vw, 72px);
  font-weight: 700; padding: 0; position: relative; transition: background .25s, transform .1s; }
.board.ttt .cell.x { color: var(--x); }
.board.ttt .cell.o { color: var(--o); }
.board .annotated { background: var(--heat) !important; }
.board.ttt .cell .qv { font-size: clamp(16px, 4.2vw, 26px); font-weight: 700; color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.5); }
.board.ttt .cell .qn { font-size: clamp(10px, 2.4vw, 13px); font-weight: 500; color: rgba(255,255,255,.8); }
.board.ttt button.cell:not(.locked):hover { transform: scale(1.03); border-color: var(--accent); }
.board .locked { cursor: default; }
.board .chosen { outline: 4px solid #fff; outline-offset: -4px; animation: pulse 1s ease-in-out infinite; }
.board .last { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(88,166,255,.55) inset; }
.board.ttt .cell.win { background: rgba(63,185,80,.28); border-color: var(--good); }
@keyframes pulse { 50% { outline-color: rgba(255,255,255,.35); } }

.board.ttt.mini { width: 66px; gap: 2px; }
.board.ttt.mini .cell { border-radius: 3px; border-width: 1px; font-size: 13px; }
.board.ttt.mini .chosen { outline-width: 2px; outline-offset: -2px; animation: none; }

.board.nim { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; }
.nim-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; min-height: 96px; }
.nim-label { width: 52px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
.stick { width: 34px; height: 92px; border-radius: 8px; border: 2px solid #8a6a3a; background: #c9a36b; padding: 0;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 2px; }
.stick .qv { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; writing-mode: vertical-rl; transform: rotate(180deg); text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.6); }
.stick .qn { font-size: 10px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.8); writing-mode: vertical-rl; transform: rotate(180deg); }
.stick.gone { background: transparent; border: 2px dashed var(--border); }
button.stick:not(.locked):not(.gone):hover, button.stick:not(.locked):not(.gone):hover ~ .stick:not(.gone) { outline: 3px solid var(--bad); outline-offset: -3px; }
.stick.taking { opacity: .55; outline: 2px dashed #fff; outline-offset: -3px; }
.board.nim.mini { gap: 2px; }
.board.nim.mini .nim-row { min-height: 0; gap: 2px; }
.board.nim.mini .stick { width: 7px; height: 16px; border-width: 1px; border-radius: 2px; }

.legend { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 6px; }
.legend .bar { width: 160px; height: 10px; border-radius: 5px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, hsl(0,70%,34%), hsl(60,70%,34%), hsl(120,70%,34%)); }

/* ---------- thought panel ---------- */
.thought .who { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.badge { display: inline-block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .6px; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 999px; }
.b-exploit { background: rgba(88,166,255,.18); color: var(--accent); }
.b-explore { background: rgba(210,153,34,.2); color: var(--warn); }
.b-forced, .b-random, .b-human { background: rgba(139,149,163,.2); color: var(--muted); }
.b-sample { background: rgba(188,140,255,.2); color: var(--purple); }
.b-perfect { background: rgba(63,185,80,.18); color: var(--good); }
.metrics { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(120px, 1fr)); gap: 8px; margin: 8px 0; }
.metric { background: var(--panel2); border-radius: 8px; padding: 7px 10px; }
.metric .k { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .5px; }
.metric .v { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; }
.meter { height: 6px; border-radius: 3px; background: var(--border); overflow: hidden; margin-top: 4px; }
.meter > div { height: 100%; background: var(--accent); }
.split { display: flex; height: 8px; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 5px; }
.split .ex { background: var(--warn); } .split .ep { background: var(--accent); }
.reason { background: var(--panel2); border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); padding: 9px 12px; border-radius: 6px; margin: 8px 0; }
.reason.explore { border-color: var(--warn); } .reason.sample { border-color: var(--purple); }
table.opts { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; }
table.opts th { text-align: left; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 500; padding: 3px 4px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
table.opts td { padding: 3px 4px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(43,51,64,.5); white-space: nowrap; }
table.opts tr.sel td { background: rgba(88,166,255,.1); font-weight: 600; }
.vbar { position: relative; width: 90px; height: 8px; background: var(--border); border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; }
.vbar > i { position: absolute; top: 0; bottom: 0; border-radius: 4px; }
.vbar::after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 50%; top: -2px; bottom: -2px; width: 1px; background: var(--muted); }
.vbar.pos::after { display: none; }
.delta-pos { color: var(--good); } .delta-neg { color: var(--bad); }
.teach { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 13px; }

ol.log { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; max-height: 340px; overflow-y: auto; font-size: 13px; }
ol.log li { padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(43,51,64,.6); }
ol.log li.upd { color: #a5d6a7; padding-left: 22px; font-size: 12px; }
ol.log li.teachlog { color: var(--purple); }
ol.log li.sys { color: var(--muted); font-style: italic; }
.tag { font-weight: 700; margin-right: 4px; }
.tag.p0 { color: var(--x); } .tag.p1 { color: var(--o); }

/* ---------- replay ---------- */
.chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 5px; margin: 8px 0; }
.chip { font-size: 12px; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--panel2); cursor: pointer; }
.chip.on { border-color: #fff; background: #30363d; }
.chip.k-explore { color: var(--warn); } .chip.k-exploit { color: var(--accent); } .chip.k-sample { color: var(--purple); }
.chip.k-human, .chip.k-random, .chip.k-forced { color: var(--muted); } .chip.k-perfect { color: var(--good); }
.replay-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 16px; align-items: start; }
@media (max-width: 700px) { .replay-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
.replay-board .board.ttt { width: min(240px, 80vw); }
.replay-board .board.ttt .cell { font-size: 40px; }
.replay-board .board.ttt .cell .qv { font-size: 17px; }
.replay-board .stick { width: 26px; height: 70px; }
.last-board .board.ttt { width: 150px; }
.last-board .board.ttt .cell { font-size: 28px; border-radius: 8px; }
.last-board .stick { width: 16px; height: 44px; }
.last-board .nim-row { min-height: 46px; }
.replay-board .nim-row { min-height: 72px; }
.seg { display: inline-flex; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 7px; overflow: hidden; }
.seg button { border: 0; border-radius: 0; background: transparent; }
.seg button.on { background: var(--accent); color: #0d1117; }

/* ---------- train ---------- */
.chart-wrap { position: relative; height: 290px; }
canvas#chart, canvas#rchart { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }
.chart-legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 6px; }
.chart-legend i { display: inline-block; width: 14px; height: 3px; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 5px; border-radius: 2px; }
.hyper { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(130px, auto) 1fr 64px; gap: 6px 10px; align-items: center; font-size: 13px; }
.hyper input[type=range] { width: 100%; }
.hyper .val { text-align: right; font-family: ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace; }
.hyper .help { grid-column: 1 / -1; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; margin: -4px 0 4px; }
.stat-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(110px, 1fr)); gap: 8px; }

/* ---------- brain ---------- */
.state-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(118px, 1fr)); gap: 8px; }
.state-card { background: var(--panel2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px; cursor: pointer;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 5px; font-size: 11px; text-align: center; }
.state-card:hover, .state-card.on { border-color: var(--accent); }
.state-card .board.nim.mini { align-items: center; }
table.roster { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; }
table.roster th, table.roster td { padding: 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); text-align: left; white-space: nowrap; }
table.roster tr.active td { background: rgba(88,166,255,.08); }
.table-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
.dropzone { border: 2px dashed var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 18px; text-align: center; color: var(--muted); }
.dropzone.hot { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--text); }
#dropOverlay { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 50; display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  background: rgba(13,17,23,.85); font-size: 26px; border: 4px dashed var(--accent); }
#dropOverlay.show { display: flex; }

.modal { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 40; background: rgba(0,0,0,.6); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 16px; }
.modal.hidden { display: none; }
.modal-box { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; width: min(560px, 100%); max-height: 90vh; overflow: auto; }
.modal-box .errors { color: var(--bad); margin: 8px 0; padding-left: 18px; }
.modal-box .errors li { margin: 4px 0; }
.modal-box .actions { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 8px; margin-top: 14px; }
.form-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr; gap: 8px 12px; align-items: center; }
#toast { position: fixed; bottom: 18px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); background: #30363d; border: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 8px; opacity: 0; transition: opacity .25s; pointer-events: none; z-index: 60; max-width: 90vw; }
#toast.show { opacity: 1; }

/* ---------- SIMPLE MODE: black & white, fewer things on screen ---------- */
body.simple { --bg: #000; --panel: #0a0a0a; --panel2: #161616; --border: #2e2e2e; --text: #f2f2f2; --muted: #8c8c8c;
  --accent: #fff; --good: #fff; --bad: #fff; --warn: #bdbdbd; --purple: #dcdcdc; --x: #fff; --o: #fff; }
body.simple header { background: rgba(0,0,0,.94); }
body.simple button.primary { background: #fff; border-color: #fff; color: #000; }
body.simple button.danger { color: #fff; border-color: #666; }
body.simple nav.tabs button.active { color: #000; }
body.simple .board.ttt .cell { border-color: #333; }
body.simple .board.ttt .cell.win { background: #fff; border-color: #fff; color: #000; }
body.simple .board .last { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255,255,255,.45) inset; }
body.simple .stick { background: #e6e6e6; border-color: #888; }
body.simple .stick.gone { background: transparent; border-color: #2e2e2e; }
body.simple button.stick:not(.locked):not(.gone):hover, body.simple button.stick:not(.locked):not(.gone):hover ~ .stick:not(.gone) { outline-color: #fff; background: #666; }
body.simple .legend .bar { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1a1a1a, #8c8c8c); }
body.simple #tab-train .layout, body.simple #tab-brain .layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 760px); justify-content: center; }
body.simple .card { border-radius: 14px; }
body.simple h3 { color: #fff; }
body.simple ol.log li { font-size: 14px; }
body.simple .adv, body.simple ol.log li.upd { display: none !important; }
body.advanced .simple-only { display: none !important; }
.bubble { position: relative; background: #fff; color: #000; border-radius: 16px; padding: 14px 16px; font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.5; margin: 6px 0 16px; }
.bubble::after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 26px; bottom: -10px; border: 10px solid transparent; border-top-color: #fff; border-bottom: 0; }
.bubble.thinking { background: #1c1c1c; color: #bbb; }
.bubble.thinking::after { border-top-color: #1c1c1c; }
.speaker { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.speaker .face { width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; }
.dots::after { content: "..."; }
.sure { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }
.setting { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
.setting input[type=checkbox] { width: 18px; height: 18px; margin-top: 2px; flex: none; }
.setting .desc { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }
body[data-kind="world"] [data-for="board"], body[data-kind="board"] [data-for="world"] { display: none !important; }
body:not([data-env="room"]) [data-only="room"], body:not([data-env="forest"]) [data-only="forest"] { display: none !important; }
#forestCanvas { display: block; width: 100%; margin: 10px 0 6px; cursor: pointer; }
.board.roomstate.forest .rs-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
.village { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
.house-thumb { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 2px; padding: 4px; background: var(--panel2); }
.house-thumb svg { border-radius: 6px; display: block; }
.house-thumb span { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
table.roster.wrap td { white-space: normal; }
.house-art svg { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 8px; }
.env-pick select { font-weight: 600; }
.single-layout, body.simple .single-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 760px); justify-content: center; }
.board.roomstate { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; width: min(360px, 86vw); }
.rs-desc { font-size: 14px; }
.rs-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 6px; }
.rs-tile { background: var(--panel2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px 4px; min-height: 56px;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; }
.rs-tile .rs-name { color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }
.rs-tile .qv { font-size: 13px; color: #fff; }
.board.roomstate.mini { width: 60px; gap: 0; }
.board.roomstate.mini .rs-grid { gap: 2px; }
.board.roomstate.mini .rs-tile { min-height: 16px; padding: 0; border-radius: 3px; }
#roomCanvas { display: block; width: 100%; margin: 10px 0 6px; outline: none; cursor: pointer; }
.room-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.7fr) minmax(0, 1fr); }
@media (max-width: 960px) { .room-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
.agent-row { padding: 6px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
.agent-row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
.agent-row.on b { text-decoration: underline; }
.bubble.small-bubble { font-size: 14px; padding: 7px 11px; margin: 6px 0 10px; }
